Subject: caps_p.h: do not require CAP_SYS_NICE / CAP_DAC_READ_SEARCH

The same edit stilliard/docker-pure-ftpd applies when it builds Debian's
package: Docker's default capability set lacks CAP_SYS_NICE and
CAP_DAC_READ_SEARCH, so a binary that asks cap_set_proc() for them dies at
startup with "421 Unable to switch capabilities : Operation not permitted".
Carried here so the fork keeps the exact capability set of the binary it
replaces.

--- a/src/caps_p.h
+++ b/src/caps_p.h
@@ -14,9 +14,7 @@
     CAP_SETUID,
     CAP_CHOWN,
     CAP_NET_BIND_SERVICE,
-    CAP_SYS_CHROOT,
-    CAP_SYS_NICE,
-    CAP_DAC_READ_SEARCH
+    CAP_SYS_CHROOT
 };
 
 cap_value_t cap_keep_login[] = {
